# Contact form backend (optional).
# If unset, the contact form on /contact falls back to opening the
# user's email client with a prefilled body addressed to profile.email.
# Sign up free at https://web3forms.com and paste the access key here.
# PUBLIC_ prefix is required: the value is read at build time AND shipped
# to the browser (Web3Forms expects the key in the form payload).
PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
